1
00:00:01,559 --> 00:00:03,080
[♪♪]

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,800
I'm Peppa Pig.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,920
This is my little brother,
George.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,119
[SNORTS]

5
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:10,479
This is Mommy Pig.
[SNORTS]

6
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:11,879
And this is Daddy Pig.

7
00:00:11,879 --> 00:00:13,320
[SNORTS]
[ALL LAUGH]

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,680
Peppa Pig.

9
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,840
[SNORTS]

10
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,360
[♪♪]

11
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,560
[PEPPA READS ONSCREEN TEXT]

12
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:26,560
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George
are going shopping.

13
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,320
[ALL LAUGHING]

14
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,240
Peppa and George
like shopping.

15
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,280
George loves sitting
in the trolley

16
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,360
[LAUGHS AND SNORTS]

17
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,080
[SNORTS]
So does Peppa.

18
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:42,080
Daddy, can I sit
in the trolley too?

19
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,280
[LAUGHS]

20
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,400
You're too big for the trolley,
Peppa.

21
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,120
Oh.
[SNORTS]

22
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,680
You can help with shopping.

23
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,559
Oh, goody.
[SNORTS]

24
00:00:50,559 --> 00:00:52,680
We've got four things
on the list.

25
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:57,199
Tomatoes, spaghetti
onions and fruit.

26
00:00:57,199 --> 00:00:59,360
I'll find it all.

27
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,839
[ALL LAUGH]

28
00:01:02,839 --> 00:01:04,360
[SNORTS]
This way.

29
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:07,080
[GIGGLES] 
Peppa and George love shopping.

30
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,720
Peppa, first we need tomatoes.

31
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,200
Hmm.

32
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,399
[SNORTS]
I can see them. I can see them.

33
00:01:16,399 --> 00:01:19,000
Here are the tomatoes, Mommy.

34
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,560
Well done, Peppa.

35
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:25,920
One, two, three, four.

36
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,000
Now, put them
in the trolley.

37
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,240
[SNORTS]

38
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:31,640
I found the tomatoes.

39
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:34,119
Well done, Peppa.

40
00:01:34,119 --> 00:01:37,839
Tomatoes. That's one thing
off the list.

41
00:01:37,839 --> 00:01:39,759
What's next on the list?

42
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:41,479
Spaghetti!

43
00:01:41,479 --> 00:01:42,759
"Paghetti."

44
00:01:42,759 --> 00:01:44,119
That's right, George,

45
00:01:44,119 --> 00:01:46,479
but it's called "spaghetti."

46
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:48,160
Paghetti.

47
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:51,199
Spaghetti is Peppa and George's
favorite food.

48
00:01:51,199 --> 00:01:53,199
I wonder where
the spaghetti is.

49
00:01:53,199 --> 00:01:54,479
I can see it!

50
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:55,839
This way.

51
00:01:55,839 --> 00:01:57,039
Spaghetti.

52
00:01:57,039 --> 00:01:59,600
Look, Mommy.
Here's the spaghetti.

53
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:01,080
Well done, Peppa.

54
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:03,280
Let's put the spaghetti
in the trolley.

55
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,520
Yes, Mommy.

56
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,800
[SNORTS]
Paghetti.

57
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,079
[LAUGHS]

58
00:02:08,079 --> 00:02:12,799
George, it's called
spaghetti.

59
00:02:12,799 --> 00:02:15,640
Paghetti.

60
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:17,640
[ALL LAUGH]

61
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:19,600
What's next on list, Peppa?

62
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,720
Crisps.

63
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:23,079
Crisps are not
on the list.

64
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:25,280
We have plenty of crisps
at home, Peppa.

65
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,000
DADDY PIG:
Have another guess.

66
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,200
Hmm.

67
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,519
I just can't remember.

68
00:02:30,519 --> 00:02:32,239
Can you remember,
George?

69
00:02:32,239 --> 00:02:34,359
Dinosaur!
Dinosaur?

70
00:02:34,359 --> 00:02:39,079
George, there aren't any
dinosaurs in the supermarket.

71
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:41,359
[ALL LAUGH]

72
00:02:41,359 --> 00:02:43,040
No, George.

73
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:46,040
The next thing on the list
is onions.

74
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,280
Onions!

75
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,440
I remember now.

76
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,079
Here they are.

77
00:02:51,079 --> 00:02:52,440
[LAUGHS]

78
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:54,040
Well done.

79
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:58,560
One, two, three, four.

80
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,040
[LAUGHS]

81
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:02,040
[SNORTS]
Onions!

82
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:04,120
Very good.

83
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:06,519
That's nearly everything
on our list.

84
00:03:06,519 --> 00:03:08,720
There's one last thing
on the list.

85
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,040
[SNORTS]

86
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,880
[GIGGLES]

87
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,120
A plant?

88
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,600
Is that on the list?

89
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,399
Oh, no, George.

90
00:03:16,399 --> 00:03:19,040
The last thing
on the list is fruit.

91
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,399
Oh.

92
00:03:20,399 --> 00:03:22,880
Never mind, George.
You can choose the fruit.

93
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:25,000
[LAUGHS AND SNORTS]

94
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,519
Where is the fruit?

95
00:03:26,519 --> 00:03:28,359
Over there!

96
00:03:28,359 --> 00:03:30,600
There are apples
and oranges

97
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:34,079
and bananas,
and a very big melon.

98
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:35,359
[SNORTS]

99
00:03:35,359 --> 00:03:37,480
What fruit
shall we have, George?

100
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,679
Apples?

101
00:03:38,679 --> 00:03:39,880
Oranges?

102
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,239
Bananas?

103
00:03:41,239 --> 00:03:42,440
[SNORTS]

104
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,200
A melon!

105
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,480
[LOUD THUD]

106
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,519
[ALL LAUGH]

107
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,200
This is the checkout,

108
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,399
where all the food
is paid for.

109
00:03:52,399 --> 00:03:54,560
Tomatoes.

110
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:57,079
Spaghetti.

111
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,679
Onions.

112
00:03:58,679 --> 00:04:00,839
Melon.

113
00:04:00,839 --> 00:04:02,679
Chocolate cake.

114
00:04:02,679 --> 00:04:04,600
MOMMY PIG &amp; PEPPA:
Chocolate cake?

115
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:07,399
Chocolate cake?
Is that on the list?

116
00:04:07,399 --> 00:04:11,239
Peppa, did you put the chocolate
cake in the trolley?

117
00:04:11,239 --> 00:04:12,600
No, Mommy.

118
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,920
George, did you put
the chocolate cake

119
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,200
in the trolley?

120
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,399
No.

121
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,839
Well, I didn't put it in.

122
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,479
Then who did?

123
00:04:20,479 --> 00:04:22,360
Uh...

124
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,599
I thought it might be nice
for pudding.

125
00:04:24,599 --> 00:04:25,920
Daddy Pig!

126
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,159
[LAUGHS]

127
00:04:27,159 --> 00:04:28,719
Naughty daddy.

128
00:04:28,719 --> 00:04:32,000
Sorry. It just looked
so delicious.

129
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
It does look
rather yummy.

130
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,680
Oh, let's pretend
it was on the list.

131
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,680
Chocolate cake!

132
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,880
Hooray!

133
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:41,479
[ALL LAUGH]

134
00:04:48,039 --> 00:04:50,159
[ROOSTER CROWS]

135
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:53,479
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

136
00:04:53,479 --> 00:04:55,560
NARRATOR:
It is Peppa's birthday.

137
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,840
It is very early
in the morning.

138
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,000
[SNORTS]

139
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,520
It's my birthday.

140
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,640
[LAUGHS]

141
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:05,039
George, wake up.
It's my birthday.

142
00:05:05,039 --> 00:05:06,280
[YAWNS]

143
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,719
I'm going to have a party!

144
00:05:07,719 --> 00:05:10,360
And Daddy is doing
a magic show.

145
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,919
[SNORTING]
Quick, George.

146
00:05:11,919 --> 00:05:14,280
Let's wake
Mommy and Daddy up.

147
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:16,039
[SNORING]

148
00:05:16,039 --> 00:05:18,719
Mommy Pig and Daddy Pig
are still fast asleep.

149
00:05:18,719 --> 00:05:21,000
Wake up!
It's my birthday!

150
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,719
Wake up!

151
00:05:22,719 --> 00:05:24,280
Oof!
[BOTH YAWN]

152
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:26,080
What time is it?

153
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,680
It's very late.

154
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:30,840
[TICKING]
It's 5:00 in the morning.

155
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:33,599
Yes. The whole day is going.

156
00:05:33,599 --> 00:05:34,800
[LAUGHS]

157
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:37,080
Okay, let's get
your birthday started.

158
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:39,440
Yippee!

159
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:42,359
[ALL LAUGHING]

160
00:05:42,359 --> 00:05:45,520
Mommy Pig, Daddy Pig and George
are giving Peppa

161
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,919
her birthday present.

162
00:05:46,919 --> 00:05:50,080
BOTH:
Happy birthday, Peppa.

163
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,240
Ooh.

164
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,440
[RATTLES]
What is it?

165
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:57,240
[SNORTS]
A doll's dress.

166
00:05:57,240 --> 00:06:00,359
I could put it
on Teddy.

167
00:06:00,359 --> 00:06:01,800
Thank you,
everyone.

168
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,200
You're welcome,
Peppa.

169
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:05,560
I didn't know Teddy
was a girl teddy,

170
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:08,560
Oh, Daddy, of course Teddy's
a girl.

171
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,760
[SNORTS]

172
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,000
I love my new dress.

173
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,640
Thank you, everyone.

174
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:14,120
You're welcome, Teddy.

175
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:16,280
Don't get it dirty.

176
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:18,640
Do you know what's
happening next, Peppa?

177
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:22,159
Yes. My friends are coming
for my birthday party,

178
00:06:22,159 --> 00:06:24,560
and Daddy is doing
a magic show.

179
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,880
[LAUGHS]

180
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:28,520
No one will know the magician
is your daddy.

181
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:32,640
You will introduce me as
the Amazing Mysterio.

182
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:35,200
"The Mazy Misty Oh"?

183
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:38,719
Yes, the Amazing Mysterio.

184
00:06:38,719 --> 00:06:42,080
Daddy's been practicing
his magic tricks all week.

185
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,440
[DOORBELL RINGS]

186
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:45,200
My friends are here!

187
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:47,200
[LAUGHING]
Yippee!

188
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,120
Here are Peppa's friends.

189
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:51,680
Candy Cat, Suzy Sheep,
Danny Dog,

190
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,919
Rebecca Rabbit
and Pedro Pony.

191
00:06:53,919 --> 00:06:55,080
Hello, everyone.

192
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,919
ALL:
Happy birthday, Peppa.

193
00:06:56,919 --> 00:06:58,359
[ALL MAKING ANIMAL NOISES]

194
00:06:58,359 --> 00:07:00,640
Come on, children.
The party is starting.

195
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:02,919
ALL:
Hooray!

196
00:07:02,919 --> 00:07:07,000
Daddy Pig is going to do
a magic show.

197
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,479
Peppa, remember what
you have to say:

198
00:07:09,479 --> 00:07:11,599
"Ladies and gentlemen,

199
00:07:11,599 --> 00:07:15,400
introducing
the Amazing Mysterio"

200
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,239
Okay, Daddy.

201
00:07:17,239 --> 00:07:19,640
Ladies and gentlemen.

202
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:22,560
Uh, it's magic daddy.

203
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,919
ALL:
Hooray!

204
00:07:23,919 --> 00:07:25,479
[ALL CLAP]

205
00:07:25,479 --> 00:07:28,320
For my first trick...

206
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:31,760
abracadabra!

207
00:07:33,479 --> 00:07:34,719
[ALL GASP]

208
00:07:34,719 --> 00:07:36,960
Wow! It's Teddy.

209
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,599
[ALL CLAP]

210
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,719
For my next trick,

211
00:07:40,719 --> 00:07:42,840
I need a helper
from the audience.

212
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,680
ALL:
Me! Me! Me! Me!

213
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,680
[LAUGHS]
I just need one.

214
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,919
[SNORTS]

215
00:07:47,919 --> 00:07:49,960
Young lady,
you put your hand up first.

216
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:52,320
Can you tell the audience
your name?

217
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,520
[BLEATS]

218
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:54,840
Suzy Sheep.

219
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:57,560
Okay, Suzy.
Here are three balls.

220
00:07:57,560 --> 00:08:00,640
A red one, a blue one
and a yellow one.

221
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,200
Okay.

222
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:06,679
You have to secretly choose one
while my back is turned.

223
00:08:06,679 --> 00:08:08,320
Okay.

224
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:10,880
Have you chosen one?
Yes.

225
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,840
Abracadabra.

226
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:15,359
You chose yellow.

227
00:08:15,359 --> 00:08:17,000
No.

228
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,320
Uh, abracadabra.

229
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:21,320
Blue.
No.

230
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,799
Abracadabra.

231
00:08:22,799 --> 00:08:24,359
Red.
Yes!

232
00:08:24,359 --> 00:08:25,719
It is red.

233
00:08:25,719 --> 00:08:27,039
ALL:
Hooray!

234
00:08:27,039 --> 00:08:28,919
[ALL CLAP]

235
00:08:28,919 --> 00:08:32,799
Silly magic daddy,
you said all three colors.

236
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:35,400
Shush, Peppa.
Don't tell anyone.

237
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:37,760
[ALL GIGGLE]

238
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:40,480
Would you like
one more trick?

239
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,919
ALL:
Yes, please.

240
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,039
Ooh!

241
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,959
DADDY PIG:
Close your eyes.

242
00:08:45,959 --> 00:08:47,439
No looking.

243
00:08:47,439 --> 00:08:50,920
Say the magic words:
"Abracadabra."

244
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:53,640
ALL:
Abracadabra.

245
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:55,400
Open your eyes.

246
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,760
Ooh.

247
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,880
Hooray!

248
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:01,079
My banana
birthday cake.

249
00:09:01,079 --> 00:09:02,560
Blow the candles out, Peppa.

250
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:04,880
[INHALES AND BLOWS]

251
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:06,520
ALL:
Hooray!

252
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,360
Happy birthday, Peppa.

253
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,760
Thank you, everyone.

254
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:12,560
This is my best
birthday ever.

255
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,959
[ALL LAUGH]

256
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:22,120
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

257
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,400
NARRATOR:
Mr. Zebra, the postman,

258
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:26,720
is delivering a parcel
to Peppa's house.

259
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:29,240
[DOORBELL RINGS]

260
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,480
Parcel for you,
Mr. Pig.

261
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,959
Thank you, Mr. Zebra.

262
00:09:33,959 --> 00:09:35,280
[SNORTS]
Goodbye!

263
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,800
[HORN HONKS]

264
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,880
Look, I just got a parcel
in the post.

265
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:43,000
Can anyone guess
what's inside?

266
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,280
Dinosaur.

267
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,680
Oh, George.

268
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:49,560
You always say dinosaur
for everything.

269
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,079
[LAUGHS]

270
00:09:51,079 --> 00:09:54,240
The parcel is far too small
to have a dinosaur inside.

271
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:57,040
Hmm, I think it's a...

272
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,680
a new toy!

273
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:01,040
You're very close.

274
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,319
I know what it is.

275
00:10:02,319 --> 00:10:03,600
Your new camera.

276
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,160
A new toy for Daddy Pig.

277
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:07,040
That's right.

278
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,839
It's a movie camera.

279
00:10:09,839 --> 00:10:11,079
[SNORTS]

280
00:10:11,079 --> 00:10:12,560
We can make movies with it

281
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,360
and watch them
on our television.

282
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:16,360
Can I use it first,
Daddy?

283
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,760
[CHUCKLES]

284
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:20,199
It's a bit too difficult
for children to use.

285
00:10:20,199 --> 00:10:22,520
Even I need to read
the instructions.

286
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,680
Hmm.

287
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:27,319
It's a bit harder
than I thought.

288
00:10:27,319 --> 00:10:30,560
Suzy Sheep's mommy
has a movie camera.

289
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:33,160
She switches it on
like this.

290
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,920
[BEEPS]

291
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,880
Oh. Well done, Peppa.

292
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,720
CAMERA:
Thank you for purchasing
the Movie 3000.

293
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,880
[BEEPS]

294
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,480
I am eager
and ready to shoot

295
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,959
your first movie.

296
00:10:43,959 --> 00:10:45,839
Is there a way
to turn off that voice?

297
00:10:45,839 --> 00:10:48,199
I'm not sure.
[BEEPS]

298
00:10:48,199 --> 00:10:50,959
Thank you for purchasing
the Movie 3000.

299
00:10:50,959 --> 00:10:55,280
On Suzy's camera you just press
this button to stop it talking.

300
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,480
[BEEPS]

301
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,880
Thank you for purchasing--

302
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:59,959
Now it won't talk
anymore.

303
00:10:59,959 --> 00:11:01,520
Well done, Peppa.

304
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,520
What shall I film first?

305
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,800
Film me!

306
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:06,079
[SNORTS AND LAUGHS]

307
00:11:06,079 --> 00:11:07,439
Okay, Peppa.

308
00:11:07,439 --> 00:11:10,040
[CAMERA BEEPS AND WHIRS]
Hello. I'm Peppa Pig.

309
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,520
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

310
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:12,800
[BOTH LAUGH]

311
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,719
Come on, everyone.

312
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:19,199
[STATIC CRACKLES]

313
00:11:19,199 --> 00:11:20,839
Hello. I'm Peppa Pig.

314
00:11:20,839 --> 00:11:22,640
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

315
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,480
[ALL LAUGH]

316
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,800
Again, again.

317
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:27,160
Okay.

318
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,439
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

319
00:11:28,439 --> 00:11:29,600
[SPED-UP AUDIO]

320
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,719
Hello. I'm Peppa Pig.

321
00:11:31,719 --> 00:11:32,959
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

322
00:11:32,959 --> 00:11:34,199
[ALL LAUGHING]

323
00:11:34,199 --> 00:11:35,480
Again, again.

324
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,480
[SPED-UP AUDIO]

325
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,600
Hello. I'm Peppa Pig.

326
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,839
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

327
00:11:40,839 --> 00:11:42,400
[LAUGHS]
Again, again.

328
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:43,560
[CHUCKLES]

329
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,839
Maybe we should film
something new.

330
00:11:45,839 --> 00:11:47,240
I know.

331
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,800
Daddy Pig
must leave the room,

332
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,760
and we'll make a movie
to show him.

333
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:52,719
This way.

334
00:11:52,719 --> 00:11:56,120
NARRATOR:
Daddy Pig has to wait in
the kitchen while Mommy Pig

335
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:59,280
Peppa and George
make a secret movie.

336
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,319
No peeking, Daddy Pig.

337
00:12:01,319 --> 00:12:02,800
[LAUGHS]

338
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,160
[BOTH GIGGLING]

339
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,959
We all have to do
something.

340
00:12:05,959 --> 00:12:08,319
George, do you want
to go first?

341
00:12:08,319 --> 00:12:10,360
[SNORTS]
[CAMERA BEEPS]

342
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,360
[LAUGHTER]

343
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,560
[SNORTS]

344
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,719
Are you ready?

345
00:12:14,719 --> 00:12:16,400
Can I come in
and see the movie?

346
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:17,839
MOMMY PIG:
Finished!

347
00:12:17,839 --> 00:12:19,800
You can come in now.

348
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:23,040
George has made a movie,
and so has Peppa.

349
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,959
Let's see George's movie first.

350
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,319
[SNORTING]

351
00:12:27,319 --> 00:12:30,000
Dinosaur. Grrr.

352
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,800
George is pretending
to be a dinosaur.

353
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:34,079
Grrr.

354
00:12:34,079 --> 00:12:36,959
That's a very scary
dinosaur.

355
00:12:36,959 --> 00:12:38,280
[ROARS]

356
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:40,599
[CRIES]

357
00:12:40,599 --> 00:12:42,920
NARRATOR:
Oh, dear. George is frightened.

358
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:44,560
Don't be frightened,
George.

359
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:48,079
That's not a real dinosaur
on TV. It's you.

360
00:12:48,079 --> 00:12:49,319
[ROARING]

361
00:12:49,319 --> 00:12:51,839
Grrr. Dinosaur.

362
00:12:51,839 --> 00:12:54,360
[ALL LAUGH]

363
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:57,319
Now let's see Peppa's movie.

364
00:12:57,319 --> 00:12:59,680
Ho, ho, ho.

365
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:01,920
Who is that meant to be?

366
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:05,800
I am Daddy Pig.
Ho, ho, ho.

367
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,640
I see.

368
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:10,240
My tummy is very big,

369
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:15,319
because I eat
a lot of cookies.

370
00:13:15,319 --> 00:13:16,839
[ALL LAUGH]

371
00:13:16,839 --> 00:13:18,719
My tummy is not big.

372
00:13:18,719 --> 00:13:19,959
[SNORTS]

373
00:13:19,959 --> 00:13:21,880
But it is true
that I like cookies.

374
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:25,160
And the more you eat,
the bigger your tummy gets.

375
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:27,240
[ALL LAUGH]

376
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,520
Okay, what's next?

377
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:32,120
This is my sweet
little brother, George.

378
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,280
[SNORTS]

379
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,160
This is Mommy Pig.
[SNORTS]

380
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,680
This is me.

381
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,920
[SNORTS]

382
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,079
[ALL LAUGHING]

383
00:13:39,079 --> 00:13:42,120
And this is the real
Daddy Pig.

384
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,959
[SNORTS LOUDLY]

385
00:13:43,959 --> 00:13:45,920
[ALL LAUGH]

386
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,560
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

387
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:56,719
NARRATOR:
Peppa's playgroup are going
to put on a play.

388
00:13:56,719 --> 00:13:58,560
The Little
Red Riding Hood.

389
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,040
ALL:
Hooray!

390
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:02,240
All the children have parts
in the play.

391
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,000
They have to practice
at home.

392
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:06,199
[ALL LAUGHING]

393
00:14:06,199 --> 00:14:08,520
Peppa is going to be
Little Red Riding Hood.

394
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:10,439
Mommy Pig has made
her costume.

395
00:14:10,439 --> 00:14:12,680
Daddy Pig is helping
Peppa practice.

396
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:14,479
[SNORTS]
Okay, Peppa,

397
00:14:14,479 --> 00:14:15,560
what do you say?

398
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:17,719
I'm Little Red
Riding Hood.

399
00:14:17,719 --> 00:14:18,959
Very good.

400
00:14:18,959 --> 00:14:21,000
Then what?
Um...

401
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,319
I'm going to visit
my grandma.

402
00:14:23,319 --> 00:14:25,160
I'm going to visit my grandma.

403
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,360
Bravo, Pepper!

404
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,880
[ALL CLAP]

405
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:30,520
Danny Dog is going to play
the Big Bad Wolf.

406
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,160
[BARKS]

407
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:35,079
Granddad Dog and Mommy Dog
are helping him practice.

408
00:14:35,079 --> 00:14:36,400
I'm the Big Bad Wolf.

409
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,520
[LAUGHS]

410
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:39,040
Try not to laugh,
Danny.

411
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:41,520
You should be
a bit scarier.

412
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,040
Try it like this, Danny.

413
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,439
[CLEARS THROAT]

414
00:14:44,439 --> 00:14:47,560
I'm the Big, Bad Wolf!

415
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,800
I'm going to eat you
all up!

416
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,120
[ROARS]

417
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,920
[SCREAMS]
[LAUGHS]

418
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:54,599
You see?
Yes.

419
00:14:54,599 --> 00:14:56,520
That was really scary.

420
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,240
[GIGGLES]

421
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:00,599
Pedro Pony is going to play
the hunter.

422
00:15:00,599 --> 00:15:02,040
[BLOWS HORN]

423
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:04,319
He will rescue Peppa
from the Big Bad Wolf.

424
00:15:04,319 --> 00:15:07,040
Um, I'm the hunter.

425
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:08,719
And...

426
00:15:08,719 --> 00:15:11,079
Pedro is a bit shy.

427
00:15:11,079 --> 00:15:15,160
You say: "I'm going to chase you
away, you big bad wolf."

428
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:18,040
Um, go away,
naughty wolf.

429
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,240
[BLOWS HORN]

430
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:21,199
[LAUGHS]
Very good, Pedro.

431
00:15:21,199 --> 00:15:24,240
Rebecca Rabbit is going
to be the grandma.

432
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,520
What do I say, Mommy?

433
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:27,000
Let's see.

434
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,360
At the start
of the play,

435
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,880
you get locked in a cupboard
by the Big Bad Wolf.

436
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:33,319
Then right at the end
of the play,

437
00:15:33,319 --> 00:15:35,319
you are rescued
by the hunter.

438
00:15:35,319 --> 00:15:38,360
And you say, "Thank you."

439
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:40,839
Ahem. Thank you.

440
00:15:40,839 --> 00:15:42,560
Very good, Rebecca.

441
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:43,959
[LAUGHS]

442
00:15:43,959 --> 00:15:46,880
[BELL CLANGING]

443
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:49,680
Everyone has come to see
the school play.

444
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,360
Ladies and gentlemen,

445
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:57,040
welcome to our play,
The Little Red Riding Hood.

446
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:59,000
[APPLAUSE]

447
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:02,839
First, let us meet
the actors.

448
00:16:02,839 --> 00:16:05,000
[ALL MAKING ANIMAL NOISES]

449
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,479
[CAMERA SHUTTERS CLICKING]

450
00:16:08,479 --> 00:16:09,959
Please, please.

451
00:16:09,959 --> 00:16:13,920
For the sake of the actors,
no photography, please.

452
00:16:15,439 --> 00:16:18,439
And now our play begins.

453
00:16:18,439 --> 00:16:20,640
[FANFARE PLAYS]
AUDIENCE: Ooh!

454
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:23,199
[APPLAUSE]

455
00:16:23,199 --> 00:16:25,280
Grandma is at home.

456
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:26,599
[DOORBELL RINGS]

457
00:16:26,599 --> 00:16:28,680
But who is this visitor?

458
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:29,880
[BARKS]

459
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:31,920
I'm the Big Bad Wolf.

460
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,719
Well done, Danny!

461
00:16:34,719 --> 00:16:35,920
Um...

462
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:37,319
Oh, dear.

463
00:16:37,319 --> 00:16:39,439
Danny has forgotten
what he says next.

464
00:16:39,439 --> 00:16:41,920
"Grandma, you must go
in the cupboard."

465
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:43,199
[BARKS]

466
00:16:43,199 --> 00:16:44,719
Go in the cupboard.

467
00:16:44,719 --> 00:16:46,719
MADAME GAZELLE:
The Big Bad Wolf

468
00:16:46,719 --> 00:16:48,800
is pretending
to be Grandma.

469
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:50,800
AUDIENCE:
Ooh!

470
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:52,040
[SNORTS]

471
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,680
I am Little Red Riding Hood.

472
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,959
I'm going to visit
my grandma.

473
00:16:55,959 --> 00:16:58,120
Bravo, Peppa.

474
00:16:58,120 --> 00:17:01,800
Daddy, you must not
take photos.

475
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:03,599
Oops. Sorry, Peppa.

476
00:17:03,599 --> 00:17:04,800
Carry on.

477
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:08,159
Ahem, I'm going to visit
my grandma.

478
00:17:08,159 --> 00:17:09,359
[LAUGHING]

479
00:17:09,359 --> 00:17:12,639
Oh, you don't look like
my grandma.

480
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,680
What big eyes you have.

481
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,440
[GIGGLES]
What big teeth you have.

482
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:19,839
Grrr!

483
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:22,000
[GASPS]
You are not Grandma.

484
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,359
You are the Big Bad Wolf.

485
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:25,839
AUDIENCE:
Ooh.

486
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:27,200
Help! Oh, help!

487
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,440
[SNORTS]

488
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,520
MADAME GAZELLE:
But look who is here.

489
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:31,800
Just in time.

490
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:33,879
Pedro the Hunter.

491
00:17:33,879 --> 00:17:37,120
Help. Oh, help?

492
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:39,000
MADAME GAZELLE:
Just in time.

493
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,879
Pedro the Hunter.

494
00:17:42,159 --> 00:17:43,639
Pedro is a bit shy.

495
00:17:43,639 --> 00:17:46,320
Pedro, would you like me
to come on with you?

496
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,320
Yes, please.

497
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:49,560
[BLOWS HORN]

498
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:52,600
You are a very
naughty wolf.

499
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:53,800
[LAUGHS]

500
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:55,480
I saved you, Grandma.

501
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:57,000
ALL:
Hooray!

502
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,200
[CLEARS THROAT]

503
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:59,639
Thank you.

504
00:17:59,639 --> 00:18:02,320
Bravo! Bravo!

505
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:06,240
[CAMERA SHUTTERS CLICK]
MOMMY PIG: Bravo. Well done.

506
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:09,639
Pedro, you were
very good.

507
00:18:09,639 --> 00:18:10,960
[GIGGLES]

508
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,159
[SNORTS]

509
00:18:12,159 --> 00:18:15,200
You were almost
as good as me.

510
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,720
[ALL LAUGH]

511
00:18:20,919 --> 00:18:22,560
[PEPPA LAUGHING AND SNORTING]

512
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:23,919
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

513
00:18:23,919 --> 00:18:26,440
[SNORTING AND LAUGHING]

514
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:28,480
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

515
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:30,679
[SNORTING AND LAUGHING]

516
00:18:30,679 --> 00:18:32,840
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

517
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:34,639
[SNORTING AND LAUGHING]

